Release builds
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The macOS app uses only Apple system frameworks. The Windows installer built
from windows/ bundles Electron (MIT License) and Chromium and their
dependencies; their license files are included inside the installed app
(LICENSE.electron.txt, LICENSES.chromium.html). The build tools in
windows/package.json (electron-builder, esbuild, TypeScript) are used at build
time only and are not part of this repository.

